---
---

<section class="section about-section" id="about">
  <div class="about-card">
    <div class="about-header">
      <div class="creator-badge">Engineering Philosophy</div>
      <h2>Crafted with care in Bangalore.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about-content">
      <p>
        KFit started with a simple observation: modern fitness applications became overcrowded with ad carousels, opaque algorithms, and foreign food catalogs that fail to understand Indian eating habits.
      </p>
      <p>
        We set out to build something different. A focused, local-first ecosystem that tracks real meals in authentic portions, keeps your private data on your physical device, and never locks basic wellness tracking behind monthly paywalls.
      </p>
      <p>
        Every layer — from the Android SQLite schema to the PWA synchronization engine and voice companion — is built with craft, honesty, and deep respect for user autonomy.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-meta">
      <div class="creator-info">
        <span class="c-name">Karthik M</span>
        <span class="c-role">Lead Engineer &middot; Independent Creator</span>
      </div>
      <a href="https://github.com/Karthik77-kk/kfit" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-ghost btn-about">
        <span>View Source on GitHub</span>
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V8a2 2 0 012-2h6M10 14L21 3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .about-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 48px;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  }

  .about-header {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .creator-badge {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--apple-blue);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .about-header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 3.8vw, 36px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--text-heading);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    font-size: 15.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .about-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .creator-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .c-name {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-heading);
  }

  .c-role {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--muted2);
  }

  .btn-about {
    padding: 10px 18px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .about-meta {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
    .btn-about {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
